SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 45 - Building a Service Area Worth
 Missing Your Exit For
DESCRIPTION:Back to the construction site for another ambitious
 infrastructure project. If we're going to build a service area, we may as
 well make it good enough that people willingly drive past their own
 junction just to visit. Construction Simulator is back - bigger and better
 than ever! Take charge of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand new to
 the franchise, and build to your heart's content on two huge maps - on
 your own or with your friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Kp-PuYBGaqw
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stream-24412211@dr-ravenholm
DTSTAMP:20260813T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260908T173800Z
DTSTART:20260903T203000Z
DTEND:20260903T223000Z
SUMMARY:The Oregon Trail | Ep. 4 - Harmonicas Out, It's Time to Spread
 That Special Kind of Love
DESCRIPTION:The wagon rolls onward as we face another evening of
 questionable supplies, difficult decisions, dangerous crossings, and the
 unmistakable sound of harmonica-based morale management. The Oregon Trail
 is back in a beautiful blend of charming pixel art characters, 3D
 environments, and cutting-edge lighting and visual effects!\n\nThe Oregon
 Trail by Gameloft-Experience The Oregon Trail like never before. A modern
 twist on the trials and tribulations of the road to Oregon, this official
 successor to the global phenomenon will immerse players in exhilarating
 journeys ranging from the historically accurate to the totally extreme.
 Players will pick their traveling party, stock the wagon with supplies,
 and embark on an adventure filled with tough choices, new dangers, and
 unexpected situations. Surviving blizzards, broken limbs, snakebites,
 exhaustion, starvation, and the dreaded dysentery is no small feat; all
 the while navigating an untamed frontier to get your party to their new
 life in Oregon before the winter. Track down a missing party in the
 aftermath of a fierce blizzard, transport volatile gunpowder through
 blistering desert heat, compete in challenging hunting mini-games, and
 meet a broad cast of historic figures. With procedurally selected random
 events where players' choices affect their party and future game events,
 there's always a new adventure on the horizon every time you play.
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=QVyUTKTSmsg
CATEGORIES:The Oregon Trail
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
