SUMMARY:Sniper Elite | Ep. 1 - Karlshorst
DESCRIPTION:It's time to head into Karlshorst for the beginning of our
 Sniper Elite adventure. Expect stealth, careful positioning, tactical
 decisions, long-range shooting, and several occasions where the original
 plan lasts approximately thirty seconds. As World War II draws to a close,
 the first covert battles of the Cold War begin. Caught in the life and
 death struggle between Soviets and Germans in war-torn Berlin, you control
 the fate of a lone American OSS Sniper.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Sniper Elite
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
