SUMMARY:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon | Ep. 2 - Cheshire,
 We Are NOT Keeping Whatever That Is
DESCRIPTION:Cereza and Cheshire return to the mysterious forest for
 another beautiful evening of exploration, puzzles, magical creatures, and
 discovering things that Cheshire will presumably immediately want to
 adopt, eat, fight, or possibly all three. A magical storybook adventure
 following a young Cereza, long before she became the legendary Bayonetta.
 Alongside her demon companion Cheshire, she explores an enchanted forest
 filled with puzzles, secrets, and dangerous creatures in a beautifully
 illustrated fantasy world.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
